<LVClass LVVersion="20008000">
	<Property Name="NI.Lib.ContainingLib" Type="Str">ToastNotification.lvlib</Property>
	<Property Name="NI.Lib.ContainingLibPath" Type="Str">../../ToastNotification/ToastNotification.lvlib</Property>
	<Property Name="NI.Lib.Description" Type="Str">Base class defining dynamic Show, Get XML and Close operations for caller-owned toast sources. ToastBuilder supplies the native builder implementation. ToastService borrows a source for Show without retaining or closing it. Base methods perform no native work; Get XML returns an empty string. Override Show and Get XML to skip incoming errors, and Close to attempt cleanup even on incoming error. Create a concrete source through Create ToastSource (Poly).</Property>
	<Property Name="NI.Lib.HelpPath" Type="Str"></Property>
